codex
The paper immediately raises a serious H-gate issue: its dimension-3 family is not a hardness result; it is an explicit parametric construction, and Section 2 also gives an efficient exhaustive search in a bounded regime. I’m reading the full construction and algorithm sections now to determine whether any witness formulation avoids those shortcuts without importing a different problem that the paper never studies.
